{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651980/extras/ARENA_PLATFORMER.png?t=1749158244\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bankshot is a fast paced Arena Platformer.\u00a0 Sprint, fly and bounce your way around dynamic battlefield's that will test your reflexes.\u00a0\u00a0 Don\u2019t let the instant vaporization shot distract you from the win.\u00a0 The game is balanced to reward trick shots to knock your opponent off into the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651980/extras/ezgif-2c528ca86f7af4.gif?t=1749158244\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651980/extras/STACK_POWER-UPS.png?t=1749158244\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gobble up as many as you can, they all work together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651980/extras/powerup-sequence.gif?t=1749158244\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651980/extras/OFFENSIVE_RE-SPAWNING.png?t=1749158244\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not unlike a certain group of democratic liberators\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651980/extras/offensive-spawn.gif?t=1749158244\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3651980?t=1749158244","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651980/0d1d783108c7d332d21b01c62e0247fb970fcaf9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749158244","capsule_image":"https://shared